# The repository-level .serena project is intentional and versioned. Old
# per-CWD MCP launches can generate a second local project under core; it is
# machine-local cache/config and must never become a release input.
/core/.serena/
# Standalone DXGI feasibility-probe compiler output. Product builds compile the
# inspectable core/scripts source into ignored dist/ and never ship this object.
/capturepack-dxgi-qpc-probe.obj
release2/

# Installer output: electron-builder writes hundreds of megabytes per
# release candidate. Builds are artifacts of a commit, never part of one.
